  "notes": "### Changed\n- Ask Pyxida answers from your own notes first: it searches with key words, reads the matching notes and tells you which note it used.\n- Search understands natural questions in Greek and English, ignores small words and accents, and still shows close matches when not every word appears.\n- Faster note search, money views and AI agent tools on large workspaces.\n\n### Fixed\n- Saves are safer if the computer loses power right after writing a file.\n- Saving no longer fails when the system clock is set before 1970.\n- Agent setup files are written safely, so an interrupted write cannot corrupt them.",
